<newsitem itemid="164907" id="root" date="1996-11-04" xml:lang="en">
<title>NETHERLANDS: WERELDHAVE 9-MTH DIRECT RESULT UP 7.7 PCT.</title>
<headline>WERELDHAVE 9-MTH DIRECT RESULT UP 7.7 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to Sept 30, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>Direct investment result (net profit)  91.2  vs  84.7</p>
<p>    Direct result/shr (guilders)		5.67 vs   5.55</p>
<p>    Rental income				 140.4  vs 139.1</p>
<p>    Interest charges			     37.8  vs  44.0</p>
<p>    Shareholders equity (billion)	     1.53 vs   1.32</p>
<p>    Net asset value/shr (guilders)	   94.86 vs  86.21</p>
<p>NOTE - Property fund Wereldhave NV repeated that it expected</p>
<p>its direct investment result per share for the whole of 1996 to</p>
<p>rise to at least 7.50 guilders from 7.42 in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
